Arara Code: no Developer Tools shortcut; command only when running from source.

- developerActions.ts: Toggle Developer Tools has no keybinding (Ctrl+Shift+I is
  Format Document on Linux) and only appears/runs with isDevelopment; in a
  built release run() returns without opening (executeCommand skips precondition).
- workbench.ts: the early dev listener no longer toggles devtools on
  Ctrl+Shift+I / F12 (reload stays).

Why a patch: keybindings and menu registration are hard-coded in the workbench.
